1
00:00:00,170 --> 00:00:01,500
(Sheldon:)Hello?

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,440
(Amy(on phone):)Sheldon, are you all right?

3
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:05,110
(Amy(on phone):)When last we spoke,
you were going to

4
00:00:05,110 --> 00:00:07,640
(Amy(on phone):)take a taxi home from Raj's,
but according to Facebook,

5
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:09,580
(Amy(on phone):)you just checked in
at the Cheesecake Factory.

6
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:11,210
(Sheldon:)Yes, I was in a taxi,

7
00:00:11,210 --> 00:00:13,350
(Sheldon:)but the driver
didn't look at all

8
00:00:13,350 --> 00:00:14,950
(Sheldon:)like the photograph
on his license,

9
00:00:14,950 --> 00:00:17,580
(Sheldon:)so I leapt out and ran for it.

10
00:00:17,590 --> 00:00:18,990
(Amy:)Wise.

11
00:00:18,990 --> 00:00:20,870
(Penny:)There you go.

12
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:23,290
(Penny:)Just like recovering alcoholics
drink in the Caribbean.

13
00:00:23,290 --> 00:00:25,210
AMY:
Hi, bestie.

14
00:00:25,210 --> 00:00:26,790
(Penny:)Oh. Hi, Amy.

15
00:00:26,790 --> 00:00:28,100
(Penny:)How you been?

16
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:29,700
(Amy:)Fine.

17
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:32,570
(Amy:)From this angle,
I can see up your nose.

18
00:00:32,570 --> 00:00:35,270
(Penny:)Yeah, it's a great time
to be alive, isn't it?

19
00:00:35,270 --> 00:00:36,970
(Sheldon:)Don't worry.
My problems can wait

20
00:00:36,970 --> 00:00:39,440
(Sheldon:)while you two hens
finish your clucking.

21
00:00:40,270 --> 00:00:42,140
(Penny:)Look, Sheldon, Leonard
is dating Priya.

22
00:00:42,140 --> 00:00:43,680
(Penny:)She is staying with Raj.

23
00:00:43,680 --> 00:00:46,550
(Penny:)That means you're all probably
gonna be hanging out there more.

24
00:00:46,550 --> 00:00:49,550
(Amy:)Penny, I'm sorry
you got dragged into this.

25
00:00:49,550 --> 00:00:50,750
(Amy:)I know you're devastated

26
00:00:50,750 --> 00:00:53,090
(Amy:)that your ex-boyfriend
has found an exciting new lover

27
00:00:53,090 --> 00:00:55,190
(Amy:)with flawless,
caramel-colored skin.

28
00:00:55,190 --> 00:00:58,430
(Penny:)Okay, I'm not upset
about Leonard and Priya.

29
00:00:58,430 --> 00:01:02,020
(Amy:)Your flaring nostrils
indicate otherwise.

